### Public — register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@example.com",
  "name": "Carol",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### Public — greeting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/greeting

### Public — health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Authenticated — list users (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Basic admin@example.com changeme
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated — get one user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Basic admin@example.com changeme
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated — PATCH (partial update)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Basic admin@example.com changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carol Renamed"
}

### Authenticated — PATCH email
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Basic admin@example.com changeme
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol.new@example.com"
}

### ADMIN only — delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Basic admin@example.com changeme

### Public — Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### Public — OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
